{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDAwLS0yMDEwL0xlYXAlMjBZZWFyJTIwJTI4MjAxMCUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"Leap Year","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/i86hMi5iEF3WnYLCaGHdT5FPdYg.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6wlM6qQIiB7nb9mUYX95XjDLikX.jpg","description":"When yet another anniversary passes without a marriage proposal from her boyfriend, Anna decides to take action. Aware of a Celtic tradition that allows women to pop the question on Feb. 29, she plans to follow her lover to Dublin and ask him to marry her. Fate has other plans, however, and Anna winds up on the other side of the Emerald Isle with handsome, but surly, Declan -- an Irishman who may just lead Anna down the road to true love.","releaseInfo":"2010","genres":["Romance","Comedy","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.9","runtime":"100 min","cast":["Amy Adams","Matthew Goode","Adam Scott","John Lithgow","Noel O'Donovan","Tony Rohr","Pat Laffan","Alan Devlin"],"director":["Anand Tucker"],"released":"2010-01-08T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Anna planned to propose to her boyfriend on February 29th. This is not her boyfriend.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Amy Adams","character":"Anna Brady","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/gn0K6c6d1L6qQrRc86iL8uyIqiF.jpg"},{"name":"Matthew Goode","character":"Declan","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/3XaKKl0bKswTWbJ0Lh9nZ4UdAQo.jpg"},{"name":"Adam Scott","character":"Jeremy","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/b82C29R6fGiPoqIglQ4lzS6q2YX.jpg"},{"name":"John Lithgow","character":"Jack Brady","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ajfuBSm1HuVqFJlbTmAlza62Xxr.jpg"},{"name":"Noel O'Donovan","character":"Seamus","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/i7VJjVklFhOah8pWuCHljsxCnKf.jpg"},{"name":"Tony Rohr","character":"Frank","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/2V6AfI2kMByyOMkTNaHfI5On5x5.jpg"},{"name":"Pat Laffan","character":"Donal","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/eBXRV2pCg0WThbyG